===Etymology===
{{PIE root|en|keh₂p}}
From {{der|en|xno|receptacle}}, from {{der|en|frm|receptacle||[[organ]] [[contain]]ing a [[fluid]]; [[gather]]ing [[place]]; [[water]] [[basin]]}} (modern {{cog|fr|réceptacle}}), from {{der|en|la|receptāculum||[[animal]] [[enclosure]], [[container]], place of [[refuge]], receptacle, [[repository]], [[reservoir]], [[shelter#Noun|shelter]]}}, from {{m|la|receptāre||to [[harbour#Verb|harbour]], to [[receive]], to [[shelter#Verb|shelter]]}} or {{m|la|receptō||I receive [[back#Adverb|back]] or [[again]], I [[recover]]}}, [[frequentative]] of {{m|la|recipiō||I receive; I [[hold back]], I [[reserve#Verb|reserve]]}} (from {{m|la|re-||back, again}} + {{m|la|capiō||I [[hold#Verb|hold]]}}) + {{m|la|-culum|pos=suffix forming nouns from verbs, particularly nouns representing [[tool#Noun|tools]] and [[instrument]]s}}; cognate with {{cog|it|recettaculo}}, {{m|it|ricettaculo}}, {{cog|pt|receptáculo}}, {{cog|es|receptáculo}}.

